Verse 1:
[D]When He cometh, when He cometh [G]To [D]make up [A7]His [D]jewels,
[D]All His jewels, precious jewels, [G]His [D]loved and [A7]His [D]own.
[D7]Like the [G]stars of the [D]morning, His [Bm]bright crown [A]a[D]dorning,
[D7]They shall [G]shine in their [D]beauty, [G]Bright [D]gems for [A7]His [D]crown.

